  "system": {
    "identifier": "nara-shadow-imitation",
    "description": "<p>You manipulate your shadow and stretch it outwards, fusing your shadow with a willing creature. As a reaction, you grant the target creature your shadow is attached to a +2 to their AC and an advantage on Dexterity saving throws until the beginning of your next turn.</p>\n<p>Bright. Increase the range of this jutsu to 60-feet.</p>\n<p>Dimly Lit. This jutsu can affect +1 additional creature of your choice.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the AC Bonus by +1.</p>",
